'''Witch Enemies''' (Japanese: 魔女 ''Majo'') are a type of enemy exclusive to the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. Their body is generally a mix of dark colors.

The only ability to specifically affect Witches is [[:Category:Witch Killer Cats|Witch Killer]], which increases damage against them to x5 and reduces damage taken from them to 0.1x.

Witch is not considered a trait, yet it isn't considered [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] either, and unlike [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]], [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] and [[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]], it never overlaps with other types, meaning any ability that targets enemies by trait (i.e. any ability that can be [[Curse]]d) will have no effect against Witches.

